    },
    {
      "id": "claim_083bad24685a4c5fb6050eb09f727286",
      "statement": "The two readers have asymmetric error handling: loadProjectFile converts NotFoundError into null so viewers render fallbacks, but loadProjectMetaData performs no error handling and rejects on a missing directory or unreadable meta file; because /view-provided/[id] calls loadProjectMetaData outside its try/catch (which only wraps trace-link and inconsistency parsing), a stale or nonexistent stored-project id stalls the page in its loading state instead of showing the error banner.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/app/view-provided/%5Bid%5D/page.tsx#L80-L105",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6a2b29098c588e052b8b5fae5fbe09378fed6124bbace1aad5767ce9488b5e3c:"
