    {
      "id": "claim_69ba1bfb9b5d41d1a75482ab50b033cc",
      "statement": "Every ClientFileStorage function guards against server execution: the store and load functions throw a dedicated error when typeof window is undefined, while deleteProjectDirectory warns and returns a no-op on the server and additionally swallows and only logs all removal failures, making confirmed-navigation deletion best-effort rather than a precondition of navigation.",
      "evidence": [
