      "id": "claim_3fb17acfedf34fe4b623219c4f23945b",
      "statement": "In the new-project wizard a backend error opens the LoadingErrorModal while a storage error opens the single-button ErrorModalFileUpload and aborts the redirect; the API-error modal's View Files Only fallback re-runs the whole handleSubmit (retrying the backend call and the storage writes) and on success routes to /view-provided/{requestId} instead of /view, leaving artifacts inspectable without a backend result.",
