      "id": "claim_ee63c52531224db5909759df378a9ee9",
      "statement": "MultiStepFormLoadProject.handleSubmit generates a uuidv4 storage id, stores all uploaded files plus metadata (the /load-project route allows every FileType including TraceLinks and Inconsistencies), and redirects to /view-provided/{storageId}; storage errors there are only logged, so the flow still returns the id and navigates with a possibly partially stored project, and unlike the new-project validator it does not reject FileType.NONE files, which get stored under the literal name 'Select file type' and have no getResultViewOption panel mapping.",
