      "id": "claim_0058b0c4cd834c6faaf9c47d1af9b0f8",
      "statement": "/view-provided/[id] reconstructs the result purely from browser storage with no backend call: loadProjectMetaData supplies the stored FileType list, getResultViewOption maps those types to viewer panels, and stored TraceLinks and/or Inconsistencies JSON is loaded with loadProjectFile and parsed into typed viewer models; an id-handling quirk is that the metadata call uses the raw route param id while file loads use the decoded uriDecodedId.",
