      "statement": "The three artifact viewers (DocumentationViewer, ArchitectureModelViewer, CodeModelViewer) load their inputs through the useDataLoader hook plus loadProjectFile keyed by the route id and run identically on /view/[id] and /view-provided/[id], so the panels of a backend-polled result read the artifacts from the OPFS directory the wizard stored under the same requestId; a missing file resolves to null and renders the viewer's raw-content or not-found fallback instead of panel content.",
