      "id": "claim_ab8bfac533ab440f86def5600d0dab63",
      "statement": "NavigationProvider wraps every page in src/app/layout.tsx and owns the leave-project lifecycle: when currentProjectId is set, handleNavigation opens the globally rendered ConfirmNavigationModal instead of navigating; confirming deletes the project's OPFS directory recursively via deleteProjectDirectory, clears the id, aborts in-flight requests, and only then calls router.push(nextPath), while cancelling merely closes the modal and keeps stored data.",
