    {
      "id": "claim_a748c0317f704529b54167ab985b2d87",
      "statement": "confirmAndNavigate aborts through a shared AbortController whose abortController() helper aborts with the reason 'User is leaving the page or navigating away.' and immediately installs a fresh controller so later requests get a usable signal; /view/[id] feeds that signal to its pollForResult loop (GET /api/get-result/{id} every 5 seconds for up to 240 seconds), whose fetchResult swallows AbortError so a confirmed leave ends polling silently, but the modal's Retry path creates its own local AbortController that a later confirmed leave cannot cancel.",
      "evidence": [
