    {
      "id": "claim_12c1b534b34f41a39f4fbfdebcfb4062",
      "statement": "Both result pages register their decoded id via setCurrentProjectId on mount but differ on cleanup: /view/[id] clears the id in its unmount cleanup, disarming the guard when the page is left, while /view-provided/[id] registers the id with the cleanup commented out, so the guard stays armed after the viewer is gone and a later guarded navigation still prompts for and deletes that stored project.",
