      "statement": "The navigation guard only covers callers of handleNavigation: NavBar intercepts the desktop navigation links and the ARDoCo logo by preventing the default anchor behavior and routing through handleNavigation, but the mobile menu dialog renders plain anchors and browser back/forward navigation bypasses handleNavigation entirely, so those paths leave a stored project in place without prompting or deletion.",
