      "id": "claim_7d547f5c8c7943419b065b0f4f180cee",
      "statement": "The backend never re-serves uploaded artifact files to the viewer: /api/get-result/{id} returns only trace-link and optional inconsistency JSON, while the artifact panels always re-read files from OPFS, so clearing browser storage or confirming the leave dialog permanently removes the locally stored artifacts with no way to re-fetch them for the viewer.",
